TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium with fixed O2(g)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water, pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0    0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -totals Fe S(6) S(-2)
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Fe2_molal Fe3_molal
10 PUNCH MOL("Fe+2"), MOL("Fe+3")
END
